# Copy this file to .env.local (gitignored, never committed) and fill in
# your own key. `pnpm dev:chrome` reads GEMINI_API_KEY from .env.local and
# seeds it into the dev Chrome profile's storage — but ONLY if no key is
# already saved there. It never overwrites an existing saved key.
#
# Get a free personal-use key at https://aistudio.google.com/apikey
#
# This is for the *dev profile* only (`.chrome-dev-profile/`, used by
# `pnpm dev:chrome`) — it has no effect on your real Chrome profile.
#
# Tradeoff: this stores the key in plaintext on disk, protected only by
# .gitignore. If you'd rather not have that file on disk at all, skip this
# and enter the key directly in the extension's Options page instead — it's
# stored the same way either way (chrome.storage.local in the dev profile).
GEMINI_API_KEY=
